  "brain_first": "“证据先写清，只允许往前走半步。”",
  "sort_order": 1020,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 866
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "infer, imply, suggest, conclude, probably,",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 867
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "likely。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 868
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 869
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Inference：答案不一定原句出现，但必须由文本",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 870
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "支持。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 871
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “证据先写清，只允许往前走半步。”",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 872
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 这类题区分“合理推断”和“自己编故事”。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 873
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 874
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 定位题目对应段落/人物。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 875
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 列出原文明示的1-2个事实。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 876
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 检查每个选项需要添加多少额外假设。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 877
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 选“最少脑补、最贴证据”的。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 878
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 879
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 880
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 881
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 人物行为推断 → 用行为+语气，不猜性格标签过度",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 882
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 未来行为 → 只根据明确计划/趋势",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 883
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 作者暗示 → 结合转折、比较和评价词",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 884
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 答案只比原文明说多一小步。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 885
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 把选项中的绝对词先圈起来：always, never, must, completely。若原文没有",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 886
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "这么强，优先排除。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 887
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 888
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "原文说某研究“results were promising, but the sample was small”。可推断作者认为结果值得关注但",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 889
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "仍需验证；不能推断研究已被证明正确。",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 890
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 891
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 常识替代证据。",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 892
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把 may 推成 must。",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 893
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 推断人物长期性格。",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 894
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 895
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 证据是什么？",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 896
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 有没有扩大范围/强度？",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 897
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 898
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 899
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 900
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 只能多走半步。",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 901
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 903
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 推断题允许走几步？",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 904
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 原文“dark clouds; took umbrella”可推？",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 905
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 能否推“他以前经历暴风雨”？",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 906
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. must/always 在推断选项中为何危险？",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 907
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 两个选项都合理时选哪类？",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 908
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 半步/最少必要推理。；2. expected rain；3. 不能。；4. 往往把可能性放大为绝对。；5. 需要额外假",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 909
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "设更少、证据更直接的。",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 910
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R6 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R6”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 33,
      "sourceIndex": 911
    }
  ],
